# Agent scratch directories that live inside the repository. Both are created
# by tooling, hold no source, and are large: a worktree is a full second
# checkout. Neither was ignored before, so a single `git add -A` would have
# committed the lot.
#   .claude/worktrees/ - created by the worktree tool for isolated branches
#   .superpowers/      - per-plan ledgers, briefs and review packages
.claude/worktrees/
.superpowers/

